# The image holds the Hub and nothing else. Everything is left out first; the Hub's folder is let back in.
# (The repository folder on a developer's machine also holds backups, archives and clones: none of that may enter the build context.)
*
!CHATMCP-HUB

# ... minus what the server never reads
CHATMCP-HUB/test-results
CHATMCP-HUB/windows
CHATMCP-HUB/**/__pycache__
CHATMCP-HUB/**/*.pyc
CHATMCP-HUB/**/node_modules
CHATMCP-HUB/**/.claude
CHATMCP-HUB/*.cmd
CHATMCP-HUB/*.ps1
CHATMCP-HUB/TEST-RESULTS-*
CHATMCP-HUB/RELEASE-*
CHATMCP-HUB/UPGRADE-*
CHATMCP-HUB/STUDIO-*
CHATMCP-HUB/NETWORK-RECOVERY.txt
